      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palisade%2C_Nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every June, Palisade stages a weekend‑long Pioneer Days festival that celebrates local history with games, meals, and a parade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
