      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palisade%2C_Nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Village officials say small‑town values, guided growth, and preservation of historical, cultural, and natural heritage guide Palisade’s development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
